{
  "version": 1,
  "notes": "Shared BYOK defaults for Android GEMINI/ANTHROPIC/OPENAI ↔ PWA gemini/anthropic/openai_compatible. Android is product of record; change both clients + this file together. Other Android OpenAI-compatible hosts stay android-only.",
